{\*\generator Msftedit 5.41.21.2500;}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\f0\fs24\par
\cf1\f1\fs20 Dear business partner, \par
\par
You may be claiming service tax in your invoices and Dr Reddy\rquote s Laboratories Ltd is reimbursing that amount to you.\par
\par
Where you are claiming service tax for services rendered to Dr.Reddy\rquote s, the following details are required to be mentioned in the invoice to enable us to avail input credit. In the absence of any one of the below details in invoice, Central Excise Department disallows our claim and imposes penalty as well.  In view of this, you are requested to take care of the points mentioned below.\par
\par
\pard\qj\ul\b In respect of Input Service tax invoices, following items should necessarily appear on the face of the invoice\par
\par
\ulnone\b0\tab 1. Service Tax Registration Number\par
\tab 2. Serial Number of the Invoice\par
\tab 3. Name and address of the Service Provider\par
\tab 4. Description of the service\par
\tab 5. Classification of the Service into \b any one of the Taxable Services specified by the government\b0\par
\tab 6. Taxable value of the Service.\par
\tab 7. Service Tax and Education and Secondary and Higher Education Cess Payable.\par
\par
If the above details are missing in the invoice we will not be able to pay the service tax amount to you since we can not avail input credit. Request you all to note this and take care of all the above points while submitting the invoice from 15.1.2010.  Request you to confirm to our SCM in case of any change in your service tax registration no to update our vendor master.\par
\par
We have provided list of various taxable services along with links for your ready reference.\par
\par
\pard Thanks & Regards\par
Manish Sehgal\par
Associate Director Finance \par
Global Business Services\par
+91-40-30783147 (D)\par
Mob: +91-8008558030\par
\par
\par
\par
\f0\fs4\par
